			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align RPC service with Vine contract and fix DTO deserialization\n\nThis commit makes several improvements across the Mountain backend to align with the Vine gRPC protocol contract and fix deserialization issues.\n\n### RPC Service Alignment (CocoonService.rs)\n- Changed generic router error response from plain string to proper `RpcError` struct with JSON-RPC error code -32601 (Method not found)\n- Updated debug log formatting to match actual DTO field names per Vine protocol:\n  - `RegisterTreeViewProviderRequest`: `display_name` → `extension_id`\n  - `RegisterScmProviderRequest`: `display_name` → `extension_id`\n  - `UpdateScmGroupRequest`: `label/state` → `provider_id/group_id/resource_states`\n  - `GitExecRequest`: `repository/cwd` → `repository_path/args`\n  - Various other request types updated to reflect actual Vine protobuf fields\n- Added clarifying comments documenting the actual field structures (e.g., \"Note: ... has fields: id, text, tooltip (no alignment)\")\n\n### DTO Deserialization Fix (CreateEffectForRequest.rs)\n- Fixed deserialization of InputBoxOptionsDTO, OpenDialogOptionsDTO, and SaveDialogOptionsDTO\n- Changed `>(obj.clone())` to `>(Value::Object(obj.clone()))` to properly deserialize the JSON object wrapper\n- This fixes a bug where dialog options were failing to deserialize correctly\n\n### Bootstrap Integration\n- Added `Badge:None` to TreeViewStateDTO in Bootstrap command to support the newly added Badge field\n\n### Documentation (Library.rs)\n- Added 50-level deep analysis documentation table for Mountain element\n- Documents module structure, code quality checks, TODO breakdown (265 TODOs), and refactoring priorities\n\n### Cleanup\n- Removed redundant `pub use DebugState::DebugState` re-export in Debug module\n- Added `warn` log import to TreeViewProvider/UIState.rs\n\nThese changes ensure the Mountain backend correctly interprets and responds to gRPC requests from the Cocoon extension host per the defined Vine protocol.",
			"SHA": "f8cce5b9d4aff1c669b8500becc12e6526ccff45"
		},
